      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Signs you need a new roof in Utah include an age over 20 years, curling or missing shingles, excessive shingle granules in gutters, sagging roof decks, and interior water leaks or ceiling stains. Utah's heavy winter snow loads, ice dams, and intense summer sun accelerate wear on roofing materials.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "an age over 20 years, curling or missing shingles, excessive shingle granules in gutters, sagging roof decks, and interior water leaks or ceiling stains"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Watch this short video to learn how to identify critical warning signs of a failing roof:",
        "video": {
          "link": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/YqH2s4ru-lI",
          "thumbnail": "https://serpapi.com/images/i/R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP_______yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw.gif"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Exterior Warning Signs"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Curling or buckling shingles: Edges turn upward or centers bubble from heat and moisture stress."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Granules in gutters:\nDark, sand-like material builds up in downspouts as old asphalt shingles shed their protective outer layer."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Missing or cracked shingles: High Utah winds tear loose or brittle shingles away, exposing the underlayment."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Damaged flashing:\nMetal strips around chimneys, skylights, and vents rust, crack, or pull away."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Moss and algae growth: Shaded roof areas retain moisture from snowmelt, speeding up rot."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          2,
          3
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Interior Warning Signs"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Water stains on ceilings: Brown rings or peeling paint show water is getting past the outer barrier."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Sagging roofline:\nA droopy or wavy appearance indicates structural rot in the underlying plywood or roof decking."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Daylight in the attic: Seeing light through the roof boards means decking has gaps or holes."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "For local assessments or personalized quotes, check trusted regional resources like Liberty Roofing Utah\nor Frame Restoration Utah\nfor professional inspections."
      },
